\section{Shapley Value Analysis}
\label{app:shapley}

Shapley values~\citep{shapley1953value} computed over all $2^5{=}32$ coalitions quantify each method's marginal contribution to FPR and FNR (Table~\ref{tab:shapley_6pair}).
